<title>USA: Anika names J. M. Engle president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Anika names J. M. Engle president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anika Research Inc said Thursday that J. Melville Engle has been appointed to the previously vacant posts of president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Engle, 46, was recently president and chief executive officer of US Medical Products Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Former president Robert DuFresne resigned in July, and the position of chief executive officer has been vacant since January.</p>
